1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,500
视频配音不是把文本简单朗读出来。
Video dubbing is not merely reading text aloud.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:12,500
无声画面、目标台词和授权参考语音共同约束一段目标配音。
Silent video, target text, and authorized reference speech jointly constrain target dubbing.

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:20,000
口型、表情、环境、音素和韵律必须共享同一时间基准。
Lip, face, environment, phonemes, and prosody share one timebase.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:32,000
真人案例：GT 与三种方法的已归档研究样例，不是新的 OpenDub 运行。
Human case: archived GT and method outputs, not a fresh OpenDub run.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:42,000
动画案例：同样保留方法身份和历史结果边界，不进行无证据排名。
Animated case: method identity and historical-result boundary remain visible.

6
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:53,000
平台保留完整方法，而不是把不同论文的内部模块拼成一个模型。
The platform preserves complete methods instead of mixing paper internals.

7
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:04,000
每个方法以可点击组件和可观察信号解释其独立的技术路径。
Each method exposes its own clickable components and observable signals.

8
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:14,000
没有可复核的权重、权利和运行记录，OpenDub 不会把方法标为 Live。
Without verifiable weights, rights, and run records, OpenDub does not label a method Live.

9
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:24,000
OpenDub：让视频配音方法可理解、可选择、可准备、可核查。
OpenDub: understand, choose, prepare, and verify video dubbing methods.
